title: 'Indian Telecom Security Assurance Requirements (ITSAR) - Common Security Requirements'

description: |-
    This profile defines a baseline that aligns to the "Common Security Requirements"
    from Chapter 2 of the Indian Telecom Security Assurance Requirements (ITSAR)
    document ITSAR404042308.

    This profile includes Indian Telecom Security Assurance Requirements (ITSAR)
    content focusing on common security requirements for telecom systems.

    The ITSAR framework is developed by the National Critical Information 
    Infrastructure Protection Centre (NCIIPC), Government of India.

